{"id": "EUVD-2026-28194", "enisaUuid": "8d2e5650-1480-3518-99e5-83f822bea8df", "description": "OpenClaw before 2026.4.20 fails to properly reserve the OPENCLAW_ runtime-control environment namespace in workspace dotenv files, allowing attackers to override critical runtime variables. Malicious workspaces can set variables like OPENCLAW_GIT_DIR to manipulate trusted OpenClaw runtime behavior during source-update or installer flows.", "datePublished": "2026-05-06T19:49:32", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-24T14:17:41", "baseScore": 8.5, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/security/advisories/GHSA-hxvm-xjvf-93f3", "https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/commit/018494fa3ebb9145112e68b56fe1cb2e9f9a9ed6", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openclaw-environment-variable-namespace-collision-via-workspace-dotenv"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-44114", "GHSA-9r9j-3r2w-fg3v"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.19, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "c9b6981e-6d9a-3840-9771-a1067cce2e5b", "product": {"name": "OpenClaw", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 <2026.4.20"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "d049c622-be4f-3b5b-8b0d-446a947dd76c", "vendor": {"name": "OpenClaw"}}], "isExploited": false}